// Title: UAC Bypass Using Windows Media Player - Registry
// ID: 5f9db380-ea57-4d1e-beab-8a2d33397e93
// Status: test
// Level: high
// Author: Christian Burkard (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2021-08-23
// Tags: attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1548.002
// Description: Detects the pattern of UAC Bypass using Windows Media Player osksupport.dll (UACMe 32)
// Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(TargetObject endswithCIS "\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows NT\\CurrentVersion\\AppCompatFlags\\Compatibility Assistant\\Store\\C:\\Program Files\\Windows Media Player\\osk.exe" AND Details = "Binary Data")
